# Tailwind and Design System

## Setup (already in place)

- Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` — no `tailwind.config.ts`
- Tokens live in `src/app/index.css` (`@theme` + `.dark` overrides)
- Class-based dark mode: `@custom-variant dark` + `.dark` on `<html>`
- Theme state: `ThemeProvider` / `useTheme` in `src/app/theme.tsx`; `ThemeToggle` in shared UI
- Anti-flash script in `index.html`; preference in `localStorage` key `theme`

## Styling rules

- Prefer semantic utilities: `bg-primary`, `bg-background`, `bg-surface`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted`, `border-border`
- Avoid hardcoded hex/rgb in components when a token exists
- Avoid arbitrary values when theme tokens cover the need
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `shared/lib/cn.ts`
- Keep custom CSS minimal: Tiptap `.ProseMirror` and `.editor-canvas` stay in global CSS
- Do not add another CSS framework or revive CSS Modules without justification

## Accessibility

- Preserve focus rings, contrast in both themes, and keyboard-usable controls
